{
  "sections": {
    "main": {
      "type": "main-page",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_faqTt01": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h1>Preguntas Frecuentes</h1>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "h1",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "1rem",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "text_color": "#2D4B44",
            "background": false,
            "background_color": "#00000026",
            "corner_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "text_faqIntro1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Resolvemos tus dudas sobre pedidos, envíos y el cuidado de tus prendas bordadas. Si no encuentras lo que buscas, escríbenos y con gusto te ayudamos.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "paragraph",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "1.125rem",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "text_color": "#5a5a52",
            "background": false,
            "background_color": "#00000026",
            "corner_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 16,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "accordion_faq01": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "blocks": {
            "row_faq01": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "¿Cuánto tarda en llegar mi pedido?",
                "open_by_default": true,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_faq01a": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Los pedidos se procesan en 2 a 4 días hábiles antes de salir de nuestro taller. Una vez enviados, la entrega toma entre 3 y 7 días hábiles según tu ubicación.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "paragraph",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "#5a5a52",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": ["text_faq01a"]
            },
            "row_faq02": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "¿Puedo devolver o cambiar una prenda?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_faq02a": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Sí. Aceptamos cambios y devoluciones dentro de los 30 días posteriores a la compra, siempre que la prenda esté sin uso y conserve sus etiquetas originales. Contáctanos para iniciar el proceso.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "paragraph",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "#5a5a52",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": ["text_faq02a"]
            },
            "row_faq03": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "¿Cómo debo cuidar el bordado de mi prenda?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_faq03a": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Recomendamos lavar a mano o en ciclo delicado con agua fría, del revés, y evitar planchar directamente sobre el bordado. Así conservarás la textura y el color por más tiempo.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "paragraph",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "#5a5a52",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": ["text_faq03a"]
            },
            "row_faq04": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "¿Las tallas son estándar?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_faq04a": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Cada producto incluye una guía de tallas específica en su página, ya que el corte puede variar entre modelos. Si tienes dudas entre dos tallas, escríbenos antes de comprar.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "paragraph",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "#5a5a52",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": ["text_faq04a"]
            },
            "row_faq05": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "¿Hacen bordados personalizados?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_faq05a": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Sí, realizamos proyectos de bordado personalizado para pedidos especiales. Escríbenos desde nuestro formulario de contacto contándonos tu idea y te responderemos con los detalles.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "paragraph",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "#5a5a52",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": ["text_faq05a"]
            },
            "row_faq06": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "¿Cómo puedo rastrear mi pedido?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_faq06a": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>En cuanto tu pedido sale del taller recibirás un correo de confirmación de envío con un número de seguimiento para que puedas ver su estado en todo momento.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "paragraph",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "#5a5a52",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": ["text_faq06a"]
            }
          },
          "block_order": ["row_faq01", "row_faq02", "row_faq03", "row_faq04", "row_faq05", "row_faq06"],
          "settings": {
